WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Peter Parker: Ever since I got bit by that spider...

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Peter Parker: I had only one week where my life felt normal.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
News Reporter: We reveal the true identity of Spider-Man! His name is Peter Parker!

4
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
[Crowd shouting, helicopters whirring overhead]

5
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:28.000
MJ: Peter, they're everywhere! What are we gonna do?

6
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Peter Parker: I need to talk to Doctor Strange. He might be able to help us.

7
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:40.000
Doctor Strange: The multiverse is a concept about which we know frighteningly little.

8
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:47.000
Doctor Strange: Be careful what you wish for, Parker.
